    },
    "rules": [
      "Manrope 700 only at 20 sp and above (display, headline, title, amountLarge).",
      "tnum on every amount style (amount, amountLarge) so columns of kuruş line up.",
      "Amounts as ₺1.250,00 (symbol first, dot thousands, decimal comma); Android uses Locale(\"tr\", \"TR\").",
      "Body text never below 16 sp; nothing below 14 sp.",
      "No uppercase transforms; Turkish casing (i/İ, ı/I) is done by the platform with the tr locale, never by hand."
    ],
